{"version":1,"content":"<p>名媛林恬兒與何正德12年婚姻觸礁，近日瘋傳一張林恬兒與男子的親密合照，相中男方緊閉雙眼親吻女方臉頰，林恬兒則對鏡頭甜笑。</p><p>網民隨即認出男主角正是歌手JW（王灝兒）的舊愛、已破產的富二代葉韋彤（Tarzan）。</p><p>事件曝光後引起全城熱議，林恬兒隨即</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-22T08:23:45.851798+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":122,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-22T08:01:36+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-22T08:17:12.391881+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-22T08:17:12.391881+00:00","content_hash":"648661200963031c118d41bf805f799d537641497dac602f51c45b6eedfee611","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}